  </div>
</div>

<div id="tab-blog" role="tabpanel" hidden>
  <div id="mediumFeed" class="medium-feed">
    <div class="medium-loading"><span class="spinner"></span> Loading…</div>
  </div>
</div>
```

**tl-item structure** (shared between News and CV):
```html
<li class="tl-item" data-category="publication" style="--delay:0ms">
  <div class="tl-marker"><div class="tl-dot"></div></div>
  <time class="tl-date" datetime="2025-01">Jan 2025</time>
  <div class="tl-card">
    <span class="tl-cat">Publication</span>
